# Bangladesh VAT Sales Workflow — Bruno collection

Walks every endpoint of the workflow in order. Configure environment vars below,
then run requests top-to-bottom. Each request stores the new resource id into
the env for the next step.

## Environment variables (per env)

| Key             | Example                                |
| --------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| `base_url`      | `https://erp.irlbd.com` |
| `token`         | Sanctum bearer token                   |
| `customer_id`   | UUID of a customer                     |
| `product_id_1`  | UUID of a product                      |
| `product_id_2`  | UUID of a second product               |

After running the seeded `SalesWorkflowDemoSeeder` you can copy the demo IDs
from the database (`acme_traders` customer, two `DEMO-*` products) into the env.
